        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Living creatures enter the area of the haunt.</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dwarven spirits shout profanities and insist that the PCs join in the work. All living creatures in the area of the haunt must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22|traits:mental] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for one round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is compelled to join the miners' work. At the end of its next turn, it takes @Damage[(2d8+7)[mental]] damage unless it spends at least one action to Strike a stone surface.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature takes the mental damage unless it spends two actions to Strike a stone surface.</p>"
        },
